F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years. In 2025 that same pair ran 55% of normal and September to October ran 57%. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, from 46% on grid 21140 to 58% on grid 21740.</p>"}
